<factor id="official.repeated-request" version="v0.1.0">
  <name>
    <zh>重复请求识别</zh>
    <en>Repeated request</en>
  </name>
  <summary>
    <zh>用 request signature、TF-IDF/rapidfuzz 相似度和未解决链路识别用户重复提出的同一请求。</zh>
    <en>Uses request signatures, TF-IDF/rapidfuzz similarity, and unresolved chains to detect repeated user requests.</en>
  </summary>
  <owner>evozeus-factor-maintainers</owner>
  <category>official</category>
  <stage>signal_extraction</stage>
  <runtime>in_process</runtime>
  <inputs>
    <input>SessionEnvelope</input>
  </inputs>
  <input_channels>
    <channel>user_input</channel>
    <channel>assistant_result</channel>
  </input_channels>
  <outputs>
    <output>evidence_record_set</output>
  </outputs>
  <output_datasets>
    <dataset id="repeated_request_events" semantic_type="evidence_record_set" primary_key="chain_id" retention="replace_latest_top_n" />
  </output_datasets>
  <presentations>
    <presentation id="repeated_request_table" component_ref="builtin.table.v1" route="drawer" data_ref="repeated_request_events" priority="100" />
    <presentation id="repeated_request_json" component_ref="builtin.json.v1" route="drawer" data_ref="repeated_request_events" priority="200" />
  </presentations>
  <dependencies>
    <package name="scikit-learn" required="true" install="python3 -m pip install 'evozeus-session-signal-skill[nlp]'" />
    <package name="jieba" required="true" install="python3 -m pip install 'evozeus-session-signal-skill[nlp]'" />
    <package name="rapidfuzz" required="true" install="python3 -m pip install 'evozeus-session-signal-skill[nlp]'" />
    <package name="snownlp" required="true" install="python3 -m pip install 'evozeus-session-signal-skill[nlp]'" />
  </dependencies>
  <evidence_policy>
    <raw_body_allowed>false</raw_body_allowed>
    <preview_max_chars>120</preview_max_chars>
    <top_evidence>repeat chain event refs only</top_evidence>
  </evidence_policy>
  <when_to_use>
    <zh>需要找用户是否因问题未解决而重复提出同一请求时使用。</zh>
    <en>Use when finding whether users repeat the same request because the issue is unresolved.</en>
  </when_to_use>
  <limitations>
    <zh>继续、开始、ok 等短续写不会算重复请求；复杂跨主题链路仍可能需要人工复核。</zh>
    <en>Short continuations such as continue, start, or ok are not repeated requests; complex cross-topic chains may need human review.</en>
  </limitations>
  <privacy>
    <zh>不保存 raw body，只保存 request signature、相似度、chain id 和 event refs。</zh>
    <en>Does not store raw body; stores request signatures, similarity scores, chain ids, and event refs only.</en>
  </privacy>
  <quality_notes>
    <note>assistant/task_complete 出现明确解决信号后会清空未解决请求链。</note>
    <note>相似度阈值偏保守，优先减少误报。</note>
  </quality_notes>
  <tag_labels>
    <tag type="loop" value="repeated-request">
      <zh>重复请求</zh>
      <en>Repeated request</en>
    </tag>
  </tag_labels>
</factor>
